<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel"> 
      <p xml:id="Aink171-kilavi">
        iyaṟkaippuṇarcci puṇarntunīṅkun talaimakaṉ āyattōṭu cellum talaimakaḷaik kaṇṭu colliyatu.</p>    <p xml:lang="en">
           Spoken by the hero who left [after] having united for the first time, having seen the heroine going with [her] group of companions.</p>
  </div>  
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="Aink171">
<l>tiraiyimi ḻiṉṉicai yaḷaii yayalatu</l>
<l>muḻavimi ḻiṉṉicai maṟukuto ṟicaikkun</l>
<l>toṇṭi yaṉṉa paṇaittō</l>
<l>ḷoṇṭoṭi yarivaiyeṉ ṉeñcukoṇ ṭōḷē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
        <l>The young woman with bright-bangled bamboo shoulders </l>
        <l>Like Toṇṭi city in which Muḻavu drums sound sweet music</l>
        <l>In every street, in the vicinity, mingled with the sweet music</l>
        <l>Of the sounding waves,</l>
        <l>Has taken my heart.</l>      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
